  "editorial": {
    "name": "Mockuuups Studio",
    "descriptionZh": "Mockuuups Studio 是网页版样机生成器，模板可按关键词、颜色和主题检索，另有 Figma 插件、Adobe Express 插件和桌面端应用。",
    "takeawayZh": "按关键词和颜色捞出模板，把设计拖进去直接下载成品图。",
    "noteZh": "首屏顶部一行眉标 MOCKUP GENERATOR，主标题是 'Mockups that woow, without the work.'，紧接着一个搜索框写着 'Search mockups by keywords, colors, topic...'。搜索框下面一排标签：Apple Devices、Book、Monochrome、Poster、Diverse Hands、Device in Pocket、E-Commerce。再往下按 Free mockups、Device mockups、Print mockups 三栏各带一张示例图，每栏标题末尾都有个箭头。正文里写明可以用 Figma 插件、Adobe Express 插件和 Mac/Windows/Linux 桌面应用三种方式用，一排用户评价下面是 'Loooved by designers and marketers like you.'。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Freemium",
